// - d-gen_url_structure-            : Generate URL structure
// ==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--==--
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Inheritance Line :
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Uri > Ports > Cache > Anchor  > Front > Commands (Proces,Manage,Methods) > Sort > String > Normalize
// @Uri > @Array > @String > @Log
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Call Line :
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Uri > Ports >  Cache > Anchor > Normalize | Front > Commands(Manage > Process)> Sort >
//     > Create_Uri
